# Airbnb Market Analysis

Hosts with 10 or more listings hold 37.1% of Columbus listings, compared with 31.9% in Chicago and 17.2% in the Twin Cities.

Among qualifying Columbus entire-home listings, North Linden has the lowest median price per person at $32.55.

The median estimated annual revenue for entire-home listings in the Twin Cities is $19,619.

The top 10% of listings account for 40.7% of estimated revenue in Chicago, 36.1% in Columbus, and 40.3% in the Twin Cities.

In October 2026, 19.0% of Columbus entire-home listings were mostly taken, compared with 20.0% in the Twin Cities and 21.8% in Chicago.